    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1085">

                <pb facs="1109" n="823" sameAs="frus:frus1916Supp/pg823"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Chargé in Turkey</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Philip</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-10-18T18:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 18, 1916, 6 p. m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>3043. Your mail despatch 1517, July 8. You may reply to Sublime Porte in
                    accordance with your suggestion, calling attention to the seriousness of the
                    violation by the Turkish Government of the American consular seals.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Polk</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
